{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875780/extras/sf_banner.png?t=1739368123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fresh food lived peacefully in the fridge until a sudden power outage turned it into a breeding ground for rot. Now, culinary heroes fight for their freshness, fending off zombie food. Explore the abandoned kitchen, find ingredients, and uncover who sabotaged the fridge\u2014before it\u2019s too late!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875780/extras/razd_1.png?t=1739368123\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search for the perfect strategy: in minimalistic turn-based combat, you have the opportunity to study your opponent's attacks and find the best solution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look for scraps of recipe book pages to learn how to create new units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Research and collect ingredients to repair, upgrade and create new culinary warriors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless possibilities: a variety of levels, units and enemies open up endless horizons of possibilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875780/extras/razd_2.png?t=1739368123\" /> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2875780?t=1739368123","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2875780?t=1739368123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739368123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875780/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739368123","categories":[{"descr